        "subject": "LU-16518 llite: remove unused inline helpers",
        "message": "LU-16518 llite: remove unused inline helpers\n\n... since they are no longer used. obd_connect_has_enc_fid2path()\nand ll_lov_delay_create_clear() have been unused ever since they\nwere introduced. sbi2mdc() and cl2vvp_dev() lost their last\ncallers a long time ago.\n\nFixes: fa9da556ad22 (\"LU-16205 sec: fid2path for encrypted files\")\nFixes: 19a2573e1633 (\"LU-12885 mds: add enums for MDS_OPEN flags (4/4)\")\nFixes: 006f258300e3 (\"LU-3338 llite: Limit reply buffer size\")\nFixes: 576f1994ae79 (\"LU-6943 clio: get rid of cl_req\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ife4f30b058153cc949244c1cb6668be11133c261\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67273\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Qian Yingjin <qian@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
